WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.369
-There are 15 different sports
in the Winter Olympics,

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:04.537
and sometimes
it can be very hard

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.705
to keep track of which is which.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.373
That might be because
some of their names

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:10.143
don't really do a good job
describing what the sport is.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.946
So here to rename some of
the Winter Olympic sports,

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:15.781
please welcome the hosts of
"Desus and Mero" on Viceland,

00:00:15.781 --> 00:00:17.316
Desus and Mero!

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:20.720
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.821
Always nice to see you.

00:00:22.821 --> 00:00:25.224
That's what I'm talking about.
Desus and Mero.

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:26.926
-We're here.
-Thank you.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:29.562
-We're back.
-Thank you for being here, guys.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:32.398
Are you ready to
update these names?

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:33.900
-Yes!
-Let's do it.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.301
-Let's do it, bro.
We are millennials.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:37.469
We like to rename things
that are already named.

00:00:37.469 --> 00:00:39.305
[ Laughter ]
-Okay, here we go.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.774 line:0%
Let's start with
cross-country skiing.

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:44.310 line:0%
What should we call that?
-I had to think deep on this.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.678 line:0%
I want to call it
"boring skiing."

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:46.813 line:0%
-Yes.
-Okay, perfect.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.314 line:0%
Yeah, we can do that.
-"Squawking."

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:52.451 line:0%
-That's great.
How about -- how about curling?

00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:54.420 line:0%
-"Aggressive janitoring."

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.589 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]
You know what I'm saying.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:57.957 line:0%
-I have another name for that.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.659 line:0%
I'd like to call it
"Oh, she's coming over soon?

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:00.760 line:0%
All right, let me clean up."

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.562 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.562 --> 00:01:05.464 line:0%
Y'all know what it is.

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:07.367 line:0%
-How about speed skating?

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:08.901 line:0%
-All right, that's just
"racing in Spanx."

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.269 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-Okay.

00:01:10.269 --> 00:01:13.406 line:0%
How about this? Luge?

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.241 line:0%
-"Yeah, look,
we're really good friends

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.876 line:0%
and very comfortable
with each other."

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.044 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-That's all it is, just friends.

00:01:19.044 --> 00:01:20.680 line:0%
-"He lays on top of me.
We do our sport thing.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.147 line:0%
That's it."
-"We're doing a sport thing."

00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:23.649 line:0%
-Wow. Wow.

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:26.119 line:0%
-How about bobsledding?
-Come on, man.

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.287 line:0%
[ Jamaican accent ]
"Cool runnings."

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:28.521 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:32.891 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:32.891 --> 00:01:34.727 line:0%
-What about snowboarding?

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.295 line:0%
-"Dude, I was gonna ski,

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:38.865 line:0%
but I can only afford
this one big ass ski."

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:41.167 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:45.138 line:0%
-What about Nordic combined?
-All right.

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:46.940 line:0%
I would like to call this
"this is not a real sport.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.474 line:0%
You just made this up
for the Winter Olympics,

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:49.742 line:0%
and I can't prove that."

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:51.911 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-This is good.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.146 line:0%
Ski jumping?

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:55.448 line:0%
-"Noooope!"

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.383 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-Not safe at all.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:58.785 line:0%
Not safe at all.
-I wouldn't do it either.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.287 line:0%
-No, no, not at all.
-Finally, ice hockey.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:02.955 line:0%
-"White people basketball."

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:04.089 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-That's a good one.

00:02:04.089 --> 00:02:05.792 line:0%
That's a good one.
-All right, there you go.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.893 line:0%
[ Applause ]

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:08.427 line:0%
Our thanks to Desus and Mero

00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:09.762 line:0%
right there,
ladies and gentlemen!

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.164 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:13.566 line:0%
That is our show tonight.
Thanks for watching, everybody.

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:14.700 line:0%
I hope to see you tomorrow!

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:15.968 line:0%
Bye-bye, everybody.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.937 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:22.742 line:0%
♪♪

